  <h3 id="en">English</h3>
  <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
  <p>Pause helps you wait before you buy. It is published by the developer of Pause (“we”).</p>
  <p><strong>We do not create accounts. We do not collect your data on a server. Everything stays on your device.</strong></p>
  <p>What the app may store locally, on your phone only:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>cravings you enter (name, price, note, duration);</li>
    <li>a photo, if you add one — the camera opens only with your explicit permission;</li>
    <li>your preferences (reminders, language, Unlimited Pause purchase);</li>
    <li>the history of cravings you kept or bought.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This information is not sent, sold or shared. It does not leave the device unless you back up the phone yourself.</p>
  <p><strong>Notifications.</strong> If you enable them, they are local (on-device reminders). We do not send notifications from a server.</p>
  <p><strong>Ads (free version).</strong> An ad may appear when you add a craving. If third-party ad networks (e.g. Google AdMob) are enabled later, their policies will apply and this page will be updated.</p>
  <p><strong>Purchases.</strong> The one-time €1.99 purchase is processed by Google Play or the App Store. We do not receive your payment details.</p>
  <p><strong>Permissions.</strong> Camera (optional). Notifications (optional). Photos / gallery (optional). None are required to use Pause.</p>
  <p><strong>Children.</strong> Pause is not intended for children under 16 (purchase decisions).</p>
  <p><strong>Your rights.</strong> Because data lives on your device, you can erase it in Settings → Clear my cravings, or by uninstalling the app.</p>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:micha@nextro.me">micha@nextro.me</a>.</p>

